<Slide style={{ background: '#F5F1E6', padding: '40px 64px', fontFamily: '宋体' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', height: 72, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>追问：钱从哪来</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>往前推一步</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34' }}>追问：为什么管不了？</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#B4552D', lineHeight: 1.9, marginTop: 20 }}>往前推一步——养官要钱，钱从哪来？</Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 28, borderLeft: '4px solid #B4552D', paddingLeft: 24 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0 }}>农业社会的剩余有限，养不起一套下到县以下的官僚。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0 }}>所以“无为”不是皇帝懒，是**管不起**。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, color: '#B4552D', lineHeight: 2.0, marginTop: 8 }}>把结论变成推理，链才算接通。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, marginTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.2)', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 8, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>《乡土中国》· 第 4 课时</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D' }}>17/19</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>